The '''Ferries de la Badia de Sant Cristòfor''' ({{lang|ca|Ferries de la Badia de Sant Cristòfor}}) is a [[ferry]] network operated by the [[Metro de Sant Cristòfor]] within the [[Sant Cristòfor (comarca)|comarca of Sant Cristòfor]], [[Estret Province]], [[Balboa]]. The service connects the mainland city to destinations across the [[Badia de Sant Cristòfor]] and along the Shendan coast, serving commuters, tourists, and visitors to the islands and the [[Parc Nacional de la Marjal]].

The network operates eight routes from seven terminals, with services ranging from high-frequency commuter crossings to seasonal recreational services.

